  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 4
  storyText: 'It''s raining today. The blood on the courtyard is washing into the
    drains. Somehow that makes it look less like a crime scene and more like a wet
    campus. The cats are hiding under the canteen roof. The zombies are moving slower.
    At least we don''t have to do laundry in this weather. Then we remembered we
    haven''t done laundry in four days. Across from us is the other dormitory building.
    Some rooms have curtains tightly shut. Some are torn and smeared with blood.
    Some are just... empty. Hope someone is still alive over there.

'
